xact same numbers, we can simply find the greatest common factor of the numbers in one of the groups.\n\nFor group 1, the greatest common factor is 2, while for group 2, the greatest common factor is also 1.\n\nTherefore, for group 1, the greatest common factor is 2, and for group 2, the greatest common factor is 1.",
